        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright© South Dakota Medicine.",
        "AbstractText": "Opioids are an important component of pain management strategies for many patients, but their use is associated with serious life-threatening adverse drug responses, such as respiratory depression, as well as a potential for abuse and dependence. This paper presents an overview of opioid pharmacology, pharmacokinetics and toxicology, as well as approaches to maintain or treat opioid dependence."
